  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ESNFI - Cash Based Interventions, Winterization</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, IOM is targeting households identified via winterization needs assessment for cash-based interventions such as winterization, shelter, and rental assistance in Kabul, Helmand, Kandahar, Panjshir and Nuristan provinces in Afghanistan. In addition, IOM is contributing to the Shelter and Non-Food Items (NFI) cluster&#x2019;s efforts to provide winterization in-kind and cash assistance to vulnerable disaster affected and /or conflict induced, undocumented returnees and other vulnerable groups.</narrative>
  </description>
